list.\n- Bench sales \"My Submissions\": list / summary / detail / checklist over the\n  existing submissions, plus the four stat-card flags (follow-ups due,\n  awaiting reply, interviews this week, offers pending). One rule feeds both\n  the database filter and the per-row tag; a spec proves they agree.\n  Status changes stay on PATCH /bench/submissions/:id/status.\n- Recruiter \"Job Tracker\" (read-only): the recruiter's jobs with real\n  per-status submission counts, and per-job submissions limited to candidate\n  name, stage and dates (no vendor contact, notes, commission, checklist,\n  rate or margin).\n- Submission.checklist (JSONB, migration 20260920000000): the six readiness\n  checks (resume, rate, visa, availability, RTR, links). Ticking one does not\n  touch updatedAt, so it never resets the awaiting-reply clock.\n- Lifecycles frozen: personal record statuses as the extension uses them;\n  submissions shown as the roadmap lifecycle, with SCREENING displayed as\n  Submitted + a Screening sub-stage. Employer is denied on every route.\n- docs/job-tracker/JOB-TRACKER-API.md is the contract.\n\nTests: 68 new (84 suites / 556 tests total pass); tsc and prisma validate\nclean. Not run: the migration and the queries against a real database.\n\nStacked on chore/sync-main-into-features (#19): it needs main's\ntracked_requirements tables, which `features` does not have.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-20T16:37:40-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/5cc990277a55c61f96e6329d133033bd957e827f","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-20T16:37:40-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-20T16:37:40-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["docs/job-tracker/JOB-TRACKER-API.md","prisma/migrations/20260920000000_submission_checklist/migra